  <item>
    <title>上岸记录｜保研那些事儿～</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f09c652265473020c86e35</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f09c652265473020c86e35</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Oct 2025 07:44:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好！欢迎收听</span><strong><span>半途不废</span></strong><span>～🥳🥰💕</span></p><span></span><p><span>在没更新的这半年里，泡泡和热水都在忙</span><strong><span>「保研」</span></strong><span>这件事～现在我们都上岸了自己心仪的学校，所以录这期播客来谈谈我们的感受和分享一下我们的经验～</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：泡泡、热水</span></p><span></span><p><span>特邀嘉宾：玉米、盐粒、芹菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:54</a> 开场问题：报保研机构有必要吗？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>一、什么事值得做？</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">05:16</a> ✅模拟面试 mock</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="446">07:26</a> &nbsp;✅文书修改</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="543">09:03</a> ✅多多背诵英文面问题（即兴能力；自己写问题的答案）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> ✅多参加夏令营</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="972">16:12</a> ✅科研经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> ✅面试当天着装</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1472">24:32</a> 一个人“单枪匹马”去面试得到了什么成长？（有点但不多😂）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h2><span>二、不值得做的事儿</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">34:32</a> ❎比较！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2584">43:04</a> ❎提前焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2812">46:52</a> ❎脸面重要吗？</span></p><span></span><h2><span>三、感悟</span></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2939">48:59</a> 热水的感悟：在海里游了四年终于上岸！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3067">51:07</a> 玉米的感悟：相信相信的力量！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3325">55:25</a> 芹菜的感悟：得到保研希望的时候最焦虑！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3426">57:06</a> 盐粒的感悟：找到自己的节奏很重要！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3653">1:00:53</a> 泡泡的感悟：有勇气！有志气！有决心！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4186">1:09:46</a> 寄语：去拥抱不确定性</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的节目就到这里啦～希望这期节目可以缓解学弟学妹们的焦虑，养好心态，快乐学习！</span></p>]]></description>
