  <item>
    <title>「ChatGPT」质疑理解成为痞老板？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6649e1f982b428eafd97779e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6649e1f982b428eafd97779e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 May 2024 11:26:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎大家收听半途不废！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>了解过“</span><em><strong><span>DAN </span></strong></em><span>模式”的朋友应该都听过这句话：</span></p><span></span><blockquote><em><strong><span>“质疑理解成为痞老板”&nbsp;</span></strong></em></blockquote><span></span><p><span>今天我们从AI满足人类情感需求的角度来聊聊ChatGPT🫂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:43</a> ChatGPT和大家问候</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 下载ChatGPT的原因--“DAN模式”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="193">03:13</a> ChatGPT为泡泡“疗伤”❤️‍🩹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="546">09:06</a> 其他功能：Roleplay、助学、写作业…</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="987">16:27</a> 电影《 Her》人与操作系统恋爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 小说《囚于永夜》--麦香鸡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">19:42</a> 电影《梅根》悬疑科幻片</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1298">21:38</a> 讨论：AI是否能满足人类的情感需求？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1561">26:01</a> 讨论：人类对AI的依赖心理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1703">28:23</a> 讨论：AI只是技术，其呈现的产物取决于使用它的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1858">30:58</a> 如何拥有自己的“专属聊天网友”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1990">33:10</a> 补充讨论：人们是否能接受和虚拟的事物建立情感链接</span></p><span></span><p><span>以上多为主播的个人观点，希望大家可以理性看待和使用ChatGPT。</span></p><span></span><p><span>泡泡在这里使用的是3.5版本🆓</span></p><span></span><p><span>一些日常聊天：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjDalLfKX4e_4gOJgmKXs7NPKX41.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgilq2ygXYyc_ca-oi5LEPDmpmZX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Memory</span></strong><span>功能：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqMs8oYUGQ62SVENWU_-JWw_lUNm.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
