/span></em><em><strong><span>小镇大厨</span></strong></em><em><span>的服务员被现实中正在上菜的餐馆老板听见</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>泡泡的好室友M豆，特爱尴尬的小女孩一枚呀～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1619">26:59</a></span><em><span> M豆走错宿舍还在别人宿舍里吃了个饭</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>热水call back“</span><strong><span>三急</span></strong><span>”，和泡泡聊聊肠胀气那些事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1821">30:21</a> FART</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2088">34:48</a> 这段听得我直“抠头” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Au Revoir Taipei</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的节目就到这里啦，欢迎大家在下方评论区分享你的尴尬故事！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>-碎碎念时间-</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>泡泡：</span></strong></em><span>天冷了，大家多穿点衣服哦！给大家看看录制当天的暖阳🌞</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X2pwZy9rbU9YNzJ0NmFLYXk3RHBlV3pQWkVyRlJiVjZjRjVRQVRFaWFiZmZCOVVvVmwzWlYxVHdraWJuTkdjM0dCWW0zRzVUVkJ0c253bmFOV2xTNVdhN1NRSzlnLzY0MD93eF9mbXQ9anBlZyZmcm9tPWFwcG1zZw=="></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>热水：</span></strong></em><strong><span>🥰</span></strong><span>给大家看看我的猫儿子，</span><strong><span>它 超 可 爱 ！！！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X2pwZy9rbU9YNzJ0NmFLYXk3RHBlV3pQWkVyRlJiVjZjRjVRQWhpYWlicmpIRmpuVzNJOUFPVE5nbnRNd3hFYVU1VEd3WlMwYloyUklNZ2JyZW1zcnNsaWE1cWljNFEvNjQwP3d4X2ZtdD1qcGVnJmZyb209YXBwbXNn"></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X2pwZy9rbU9YNzJ0NmFLYXk3RHBlV3pQWkVyRlJiVjZjRjVRQThacEdpYkl0Q1EwZHBFbGdBUXJXRXdqUUJweXE4YVhWYU9RYnNjdTRyZ3NpYnVxSkE2aWFDd1BvUS82NDA_d3hfZm10PWpwZWcmZnJvbT1hcHBtc2c="></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9tbWJpei5xcGljLmNuL3N6X21tYml6X2pwZy9rbU9YNzJ0NmFLYXk3RHBlV3pQWkVyRlJiVjZjRjVRQThacEdpYkl0Q1EwZHBFbGdBUXJXRXdqUUJweXE4YVhWYU9