pan>“管理大师</span></strong></em><em><strong><span>”</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2050">34:10</a> </span><em><strong><span>“美猴 &nbsp;王8 ” </span></strong></em><span>故事回归</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2329">38:49</a> 浑身是尿点的</span><em><strong><span>“美猴 &nbsp;王8 ”</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> </span><em><strong><span>泡泡 </span></strong></em><span>小学遇见的bt男</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2875">47:55</a> &nbsp;</span><em><strong><span>Ending</span></strong></em><em><strong><span>～</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>Bgm：I Like U, But I Love Me</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>Buffet邀您一起吐槽身边的“奇葩”人类，欢迎大家把你的故事分享到评论区，或者私信我们投稿你的故事​。</span></p>]]></description>
